+
+# Request
+
+A rental of 3 days or more costs 10% less than its full price. Quotes and bookings both show the reduced total.
+
+# Acceptance
+
+- 1 or 2 days: total is days x daily price. 3 days or more: that amount less 10%.
+- Totals stay integer euro cents (rounded to the nearest cent, half up).
+- `quote` and `book` return the same total; tests under `node --test`.
